    ("Ros", "For me, the ticket is never wrong. Whatever the floor is looking at is the same thing the customer signed. If that's on a screen on the wall, fine. If it's a printed ticket that reprints itself when something changes, also fine. I don't care how, I care that it's the same thing.", "ros_outcome"),
    ("Hen", "And I stop being a switchboard. Somebody asks where their job is and I can tell them without ringing anyone.", "hen_outcome"),
