    ("Del", "I can tell you what he's said to me, which is that he wants the rollout to go in without a Quarrington, and he wants the cash position to stop being a surprise. Those are his two. I'm not going to put words in his mouth beyond that.", "del_gideon_relay"),
    ("Con", "Fair. I'll write those down as yours until they're his.", "con_yours_until_his"),
