    ("Con", "No problem, thank you both. Let's talk about how a decision like this gets made here, then, while I've still got most of you. Delphine, if you decided this was worth doing, what actually happens?", "con_decision_q"),
    ("Del", "I own operations systems. Up to twenty thousand a year I can sign it, and I'd still tell Gideon. Over twenty it's Gideon, full stop. And for something like this, honestly, even under twenty I'd want him in, because if he's not using it the managers won't.", "del_decision"),
    ("Con", "And after a yes?"),
