    ("Con", "Has Gideon bought something like this before? How did that go?"),
    ("Del", "The router. The big CNC router, two years ago, which was a lot more than twenty. I did a one-page case, what it cost and what it saved, and he signed it inside a fortnight. If the numbers are on one page, he's fast. If they're not, he asks a lot of questions.", "del_prior_purchase"),
    ("Con", "And what will he want to see from this?"),
