    ("Con", "Understood. Priority and timing. Is this a fix for this quarter, or later on?", "con_priority_q"),
    ("Del", "Before the rollout. The first stores go in the week of February ninth, and I want the building running on it in January, not learning it in February. So, this quarter to build, January to be live. If it slips into February we've missed the point.", "del_priority"),
    ("Con", "January live. One more forward question, and it's Bronwyn's really. The invoicing lag, the forty-one days. Say nothing changes. What does that look like a year from now, with the rollout on top?", "con_p4_traj_q"),
