    ("Con", "On her list. What could get in the way of this going ahead? Anyone.", "con_blockers_q"),
    ("Ros", "The floor won't touch a tablet with gloves on. I'm telling you now. If the answer is everyone gets a tablet, it's dead by the second week. Screens on the wall, big ones, and the ticket prints. That's the only version that lives.", "ros_blocker"),
    ("Yol", "And Flint runs its own sheet and, honestly, we like it that way. If this means we go back to the Saginaw one, I'll be polite about it and then we'll quietly keep ours.", "yol_blocker"),
    ("Del", "Which is exactly what happens now, so noted."),
    ("Del", "And mine is the one I always say. If it's another thing to keep up to date, it's dead. We tried a job-tracking app two years ago, the crews never opened it, and the coordinators ended up updating it and the job sheet. Double work. It lasted a quarter.", "del_blocker"),
