    ("Ros", "And the floor gets a screen on the wall, not tablets. I said it, I'll say it again so it's written down.", "ros_screen_req"),
    ("Con", "Written down. Delphine, Gideon's view on that shape?", "con_asks_delphine_about_gideon"),
    ("Del", "He's nodding. Take that as a yes. He's not going to say anything on a call with fourteen people on it, he never does.", "del_relayed_nod"),
    ("Con", "I can see a few nods, which I'll take as encouragement and not as an answer. So let me ask it properly. Delphine, is this worth taking forward to a first version you can look at?", "con_commitment_q"),
