    ("Con", "Then here's what I'd propose. I put a first version together with those five pieces, in your words, jobs, tickets, proofs, crews, installed, on made-up jobs unless you'd rather I used real ones, and we walk through it together. Forty-five minutes. Wednesday the twenty-first, two o'clock Eastern?", "con_propose_next"),
    ("Del", "Wednesday the twenty-first at two works. Same room, or as much of it as I can get. I'll ask Gideon.", "del_nextstep"),
